translate schinese primalcall_verse2_c27ca283:
    centered "{font=font_narration}{cps=20}莱娜，{cps=15}{w=0.75}我的血亲，{cps=10}{w=1.5}我孪生的灵魂{w=1.0}{nw}"

translate schinese primalcall_verse2_c3c79ecf:
    centered "{font=font_narration}{cps=15}在隐秘的{w=0.5}低语里，{cps=15}{w=0.75}我们的激情便已成型{w=1.25}{nw}"

translate schinese primalcall_verse2_29e2197e:
    centered "{font=font_narration}{cps=15}禁忌的{w=0.25}舞蹈，{cps=10}{w=1.25}我们的身体交缠{w=0.75}{nw}"

translate schinese primalcall_verse2_3ffd4521:
    centered "{font=font_narration}{cps=20}在这禁忌里，{w=0.25}我寻到，{cps=10}{w=1.25}真正属于我的一切{w=1.75}{nw}"

translate schinese primalcall_chorus2_a682eec7:
    centered "{font=font_narration}{cps=30}身与心，{w=0.75}欲望牢牢攫住{w=1.0}{nw}"

